## 📊 Monitoring Real-Time System Performance

A core part of system reconnaissance is observing CPU, memory, and running processes.

### Commands Learned
- **top** — Provides a dynamic, real‑time view of system performance.
  - Automatically refreshes.
  - Press **q** to quit.

### Why This Matters
- Helps identify resource bottlenecks.
- Useful for spotting misbehaving or high‑load processes.
- Essential for system administration and troubleshooting.

