## ✍️ Writing to Files — Learning From Mistakes

I practiced using `echo` to write data into files.

### Key Lessons
- Use `echo "text"` to ensure content is interpreted correctly.
- Quotes prevent unexpected shell behavior.
- Redirect output using `>` to write or `>>` to append.

